WEBVTT

01:35.060 --> 01:39.340
It's been two years since Roberto left for Brazil.

01:41.340 --> 01:45.690
I entered Nankatsu Junior High School along with Ishizaki and the others.

01:46.050 --> 01:50.700
Since then, Nankatsu Junior High's Soccer Club has defeated Toho,

01:51.860 --> 01:53.740
a strong school and the home of Hyuga-kun,

01:53.740 --> 01:58.230
in the national tournament's finals the previous two summers.

02:12.030 --> 02:14.380
We are finally seniors.

02:14.380 --> 02:16.940
Our goal is the Summer National Tournament.

02:16.940 --> 02:20.780
We've managed to win the last two.

02:20.780 --> 02:23.220
We can't afford to lose this time.

02:23.660 --> 02:27.030
Let's all strive for our third win together!

02:27.030 --> 02:29.020
Okay!

02:29.740 --> 02:31.530
Everyone, what's going on?

02:31.530 --> 02:33.540
What's up, Manager?

02:33.540 --> 02:34.820
What were you guys talking about?

02:35.770 --> 02:38.100
We were talking about winning the nationals for the third consecutive time.

02:38.100 --> 02:41.140
I see. We have defeated Toho two times in a row.

02:41.140 --> 02:44.580
Nankatsu is now ranked number one in Japan.

02:44.580 --> 02:49.150
This is also due to the effort you put in to being Tsubasa's manager.

02:49.890 --> 02:52.810
Manager, you're blushing.

02:53.740 --> 02:55.330
What are you saying?!

02:55.780 --> 02:57.260
Don't be so shy!

02:57.260 --> 02:58.220
Hey, you!

02:59.140 --> 03:01.740
Wow, they haven't changed at all.

03:01.740 --> 03:02.820
You're right.

03:02.820 --> 03:06.460
The manager only looks more feminine.

03:06.460 --> 03:09.340
You guys, hurry up and get to practice!

03:09.980 --> 03:11.460
Let's go, everyone.

03:11.460 --> 03:12.620
Okay!

03:15.340 --> 03:16.940
This spring,

03:16.940 --> 03:18.620
junior high school students throughout the entire country

03:18.620 --> 03:21.110
begin their training for the National Tournament.

03:44.340 --> 03:46.860
Their ace, Hyuga-kun, is keeping the ball and going ahead!

03:47.380 --> 03:50.690
The captain, Shieidaini Edo-kun, wants to stop him!

03:51.340 --> 03:52.900
It's one-on-one now.

03:52.900 --> 03:53.860
Is this a critical moment?

03:54.220 --> 03:56.050
Sawada, go to the right side!

03:56.500 --> 03:58.180
Sawada-kun steps back once.

03:58.860 --> 04:00.140
No, this is...!

04:00.140 --> 04:02.290
He pretended to step back in order to lose the defender!

04:05.460 --> 04:07.110
He's on the opposite side now!

04:07.360 --> 04:08.620
Hyuga-san.

04:11.420 --> 04:13.060
Hyuga-kun didn't go for the one-on-one situation.

04:13.300 --> 04:15.420
He passed the ball to his supporter, Sawada-kun.

04:15.780 --> 04:19.260
This is Toho's famous symmetric play!

04:20.340 --> 04:21.340
Hyuga-san!

04:26.260 --> 04:28.380
Goal!

04:28.380 --> 04:30.020
Hyuga-kun did it!

04:30.020 --> 04:32.020
He successfully earned a hat trick!

04:33.100 --> 04:34.100
Hyuga-san!

04:34.580 --> 04:35.260
Damn.

04:36.740 --> 04:38.100
Hyuga-san...

04:40.700 --> 04:42.420
That's right, Hyuga.

04:42.420 --> 04:45.900
All you need to do is accomplish your job as a striker.

04:46.700 --> 04:50.940
Damn it.  I could score even if I went against them head-on.

04:50.940 --> 04:53.900
Passing the ball is just a waste of time.

04:56.380 --> 04:57.660
Sawada-kun intercepts the pass!

04:58.020 --> 05:01.820
Hyuga-kun is heavily marked and can't get a pass from Sawada-kun!

05:01.820 --> 05:03.580
Don't move, Hyuga.

05:03.940 --> 05:06.000
Just stay where I asked you to.

05:06.000 --> 05:07.340
You don't need to worry about this game anymore.

05:07.340 --> 05:11.580
You should avoid unnecessary physical risk in preparation for our next game.

05:11.580 --> 05:12.670
Damn it!

05:12.670 --> 05:16.220
I could easily break through this kind of marking and score!

05:16.610 --> 05:20.460
This kind of soccer style is what's preventing me from defeating Ohzora Tsubasa!

05:22.910 --> 05:25.890
Playing soccer at this level...

05:25.890 --> 05:30.660
Kojiro, have you forgotten the aggressive soccer I've taught you?

05:31.140 --> 05:31.940
Sorimachi-san!

05:33.240 --> 05:33.940
Damn!

05:34.170 --> 05:36.940
Is it the end of the game?

05:37.180 --> 05:39.460
There is only the injury time left.

05:43.060 --> 05:46.060
Wakashimazu-kun makes a wonderful save!

05:47.300 --> 05:50.700
And the whistle announces the end of the game!

05:50.700 --> 05:52.140
3-0!

05:52.140 --> 05:54.060
It's Toho Academy's victory!

06:17.460 --> 06:18.780
Hyuga-san...

06:20.920 --> 06:22.110
Kojiro!

06:25.570 --> 06:27.020
Coach Kira!

06:29.200 --> 06:30.640
Long time no see!

06:30.640 --> 06:34.100
When did you turn into such a wimp?

06:35.580 --> 06:39.500
Now you are like a tiger without fangs.

06:39.500 --> 06:41.500
No one fears such a tiger!

06:43.020 --> 06:45.870
Before, even if you were winning,

06:45.870 --> 06:48.580
you always had the desire to score one more.

06:48.580 --> 06:50.640
But what kind of game did you just play?!

06:52.030 --> 06:55.460
I didn't teach you to play soccer like this.

06:56.820 --> 07:03.460
In Toho, you can focus on playing soccer, but you lose your fighting spirit.

07:04.300 --> 07:05.460
T-That's because...

07:05.830 --> 07:10.500
Your only goal was to be scouted by Toho Academy?

07:10.860 --> 07:11.980
No...!

07:12.540 --> 07:15.980
My goals aren't that small!

07:18.180 --> 07:21.190
If you continue to play soccer this way,

07:21.190 --> 07:25.980
you'll gradually be surpassed by Ohzara Tsubasa, Wakabayashi, and Misaki!

07:27.140 --> 07:32.620
Kojiro, I've opened a soccer dojo where I train young players.

07:33.380 --> 07:37.020
If you want to regain your burning, struggling spirit,

07:37.020 --> 07:40.210
you can stop by at any time.

07:45.700 --> 07:46.980
Coach Kira...

07:47.940 --> 07:49.340
Hyuga-san...

07:58.120 --> 08:02.420
It seems that Hyuga has finally gotten accustomed to our soccer style.

08:02.850 --> 08:07.000
When he first entered our school, he was always talking about one-on-one battles.

08:07.410 --> 08:10.230
It was such a hassle.

08:10.230 --> 08:13.460
If he had listened to me from the beginning,

08:13.760 --> 08:17.940
Nankatsu would not have been able to win the tournament for the last two years so easily.

08:18.540 --> 08:24.380
It is you who couldn't use Hyuga-kun at his best, Coach Kitazume.

08:24.900 --> 08:27.720
If you had let Hyuga-kun play freely,

08:27.720 --> 08:30.320
he might not have been defeated by Nankatsu's Ohzara Tsubasa,

08:30.320 --> 08:33.800
leaving Toho with a mere second place.

08:34.040 --> 08:35.420
Coach!

08:35.420 --> 08:36.740
What's the matter?

08:36.740 --> 08:39.500
Hyuga-san didn't come back to the dorm, yet.

08:39.500 --> 08:41.860
We've searched throughout the entire school, but he hasn't turned up.

08:41.860 --> 08:43.080
What?

08:55.570 --> 08:59.190
Now you are like a tiger without fangs.

09:00.170 --> 09:02.430
No one fears such a tiger!

09:06.380 --> 09:09.670
Before, in order to help your family,

09:09.670 --> 09:13.120
you practiced hard while working.

09:13.120 --> 09:18.460
This rigorous environment led to your ferociousness.

09:18.470 --> 09:20.260
All right!  Rush in!

09:21.130 --> 09:22.260
Not like that!

09:22.260 --> 09:24.060
Rush in with more power.

09:24.560 --> 09:29.060
When the ball is in front of the goal, you don't have to fear it, just rush over to it.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.740
It's time.

09:32.240 --> 09:35.220
Sorry, everyone, I have to leave now.

09:37.520 --> 09:40.460
Listen... don't be afraid to rush into it.

09:40.460 --> 09:42.460
Okay, we got it.

09:43.340 --> 09:46.800
That is the way you were, so everyone followed you.

09:48.860 --> 09:51.460
But if you keep this up,

09:51.460 --> 09:54.690
Wakashimazu and Takeshi, who followed you into Toho Academy,

09:54.690 --> 09:57.450
will succumb to the same fate as you.

10:06.860 --> 10:08.540
Did you find Hyuga-san?

10:08.540 --> 10:09.700
No...

10:09.700 --> 10:12.990
The final game of the city tournament is only one week away.

10:12.990 --> 10:16.900
I think Hyuga-san has something on his mind.

10:16.900 --> 10:22.900
Even if he isn't back in time for the final game, he will definitely be here for the national tournament.

10:23.960 --> 10:25.910
I also want to believe that,

10:25.910 --> 10:26.900
but...

10:26.900 --> 10:30.040
Sawada, you just joined Toho this year,

10:30.040 --> 10:32.320
so you might not know about this.

10:32.320 --> 10:36.980
Hyuga-san and Coach Kitazume have had some serious arguments.

10:37.430 --> 10:38.980
Arguments?

10:38.980 --> 10:44.610
But Hyuga-san had no choice and finally decided to follow Coach Kitazume's teachings.

10:44.610 --> 10:47.020
We are regular students, so we don't have to,

10:47.020 --> 10:51.880
but Hyuga-san is on a soccer scholarship, so he has to listen to the coach.

10:51.880 --> 10:55.340
But being defeated by Nankatsu these past two years...

10:55.860 --> 10:58.340
I understand the feelings he wants to rid himself of.

10:58.940 --> 11:03.780
From now on, we have to fight without Hyuga-san in the city tournament's finals.

11:04.180 --> 11:07.340
If we can't climb this hurdle, we'll have no chance in the national tournament.

11:07.990 --> 11:12.300
Until our captain is back, we will keep winning!

11:12.300 --> 11:13.140
That's right!

11:13.140 --> 11:16.930
Hyuga-san will definitely be back before the national tournament begins!

11:29.020 --> 11:31.780
Don't tell me you're already giving up!  It's not even hot!

11:31.780 --> 11:33.520
Okay!

11:33.520 --> 11:37.020
Overcome this heat and mold a courageous spirit!

11:37.580 --> 11:40.500
Fight with the beach to make your feet and waist stronger.

11:40.500 --> 11:43.750
In soccer, the most important things are vitality and physical strength!

11:43.750 --> 11:44.740
Okay!

11:48.100 --> 11:49.180
Coach Kira.

11:53.760 --> 11:55.540
You're here, Kojiro.

11:55.540 --> 11:56.640
Yeah.

12:11.180 --> 12:14.260
Sorimachi, take over Hyuga's position.

12:14.680 --> 12:16.210
O... Okay.

12:16.830 --> 12:17.950
Coach.

12:17.950 --> 12:19.260
What is it, Sawada?

12:19.640 --> 12:23.410
I think Hyuga-san has his own ideals.

12:23.410 --> 12:24.780
So what?!

12:24.780 --> 12:26.220
Because he has his own ideals,

12:26.220 --> 12:27.900
he believes in us.

12:27.900 --> 12:29.820
He left the game of the city finals to us

12:29.820 --> 12:32.330
and decided to go away.

12:32.330 --> 12:36.040
Hyuga-san will definitely be back before the national tournament begins.

12:36.040 --> 12:36.700
So...

12:36.700 --> 12:38.820
He doesn't have to come back.

12:38.820 --> 12:46.480
We don't need a captain who disappears right before the finals.

12:46.480 --> 12:49.540
We will compete in the national tournament without Hyuga!

12:49.930 --> 12:50.900
What?!

12:51.220 --> 12:52.560
That can't be...

12:52.560 --> 12:53.860
What should we do?

13:00.310 --> 13:05.600
This is the Shizuoka Tournament, and there is little time left before the winner is decided.

13:09.150 --> 13:13.250
Oh, Nankatsu's captain, Ohzora Tsubasa, steals the ball and attacks Otomo's defensive line!

13:13.250 --> 13:17.400
Otomo's four-man team comes to stop him!

13:17.400 --> 13:19.580
What is Tsubasa-kun going to do?!

13:19.580 --> 13:20.580
Izawa!

13:21.080 --> 13:21.930
What?!

13:23.240 --> 13:23.860
Damn it!

13:25.870 --> 13:30.340
Nankatsu is going to crush Otomo Junior High's defense with their fast passing.

13:30.340 --> 13:31.620
We can't get the ball!

13:31.620 --> 13:33.500
All right, let's keep this pace and head towards the goal.

13:33.500 --> 13:35.180
I won't let you do that!

13:35.740 --> 13:36.780
Here, Taki!

13:37.880 --> 13:43.060
Nankatsu breaks their rival's defense and returns the ball to their play-maker, Tsubasa-kun!

13:45.050 --> 13:45.620
Kisugi!

13:45.620 --> 13:48.860
Tsubasa-kun passes and continues to run towards the goal!

13:49.210 --> 13:49.620
In the center...

13:50.010 --> 13:53.040
Kisugi-kun passes the ball to Tsubasa-kun!

13:53.780 --> 13:55.900
Go for it, Tsubasa-kun!

13:57.530 --> 13:59.580
What a great shot!

13:59.580 --> 14:01.450
He did it!

14:01.450 --> 14:03.800
Otomo Junior High's goalkeeper couldn't even move!

14:03.800 --> 14:04.500
All right!

14:04.500 --> 14:07.060
Great!  He did it!

14:07.810 --> 14:10.620
Oh my, I'm beginning to look like a cheerleader.

14:11.190 --> 14:13.860
And we're into injury time.

14:13.860 --> 14:15.380
Damn it.

14:15.820 --> 14:18.380
Otomo Junior High doesn't give up and continues to run forward.

14:18.690 --> 14:19.380
Captain!

14:21.240 --> 14:21.860
Go!

14:21.860 --> 14:23.460
Hyuga-kun passes to Nitta-kun, who is in the front of goal.

14:23.460 --> 14:26.380
There is no time to trap the ball, the only way is to shoot directly.

14:27.220 --> 14:28.460
I will make this!

14:29.700 --> 14:32.220
This is my Falcon Shot!

14:33.170 --> 14:33.820
Make it!

14:35.170 --> 14:36.140
That was close!

14:36.140 --> 14:38.340
It barely missed!

14:40.140 --> 14:42.140
The game is over!

14:42.140 --> 14:45.140
Nankatsu Junior High wins the Shizuoka Tournament!

14:45.640 --> 14:46.420
Damn it!

14:50.020 --> 14:52.360
During this tournament, the audience has paid close attention to

14:52.360 --> 14:55.360
Otomo Junior High's freshman striker, Nitta-kun, and his Falcon Shot,

14:55.360 --> 14:57.740
but it was one step away from being a goal.

14:58.120 --> 14:59.500
Damn!

14:59.500 --> 15:02.980
If I could have completed the Falcon Shot a little earlier...

15:03.400 --> 15:04.260
Shit!

15:04.260 --> 15:07.940
This year, Nankatsu Junior High, led by Ohzora Tsubasa-kun, seems to be very tough!

15:07.940 --> 15:10.820
They will now be entering the national tournament for their third year in a row!

15:11.220 --> 15:13.200
Sorry, Nitta.

15:13.200 --> 15:15.480
We couldn't get the ball to you.

15:15.480 --> 15:17.260
It was our fault.

15:17.260 --> 15:20.140
It was not your fault.

15:21.240 --> 15:24.320
I'm the one who lost to Ohzora Tsubasa.

15:26.320 --> 15:29.020
In this game, I decided...

15:29.020 --> 15:35.510
that my goal was to catch up and surpass you, Tsubasa-senpai.

15:36.850 --> 15:41.010
The final game of the Tokyo Tournament is proceeding with a very one-sided game.

15:42.310 --> 15:44.920
Although Toho Academy is missing their captain, Hyuga-kun,

15:44.920 --> 15:48.340
their attacking power hasn't weakened at all.

15:49.600 --> 15:50.340
Sawada!

15:50.340 --> 15:50.980
Okay!

15:53.650 --> 15:55.500
Goal!

15:55.500 --> 15:59.660
Freshman player, Sawada-kun, scored again with a powerful shot!

16:01.660 --> 16:03.380
Kisei Junior High's attack.

16:05.220 --> 16:06.060
Come!

16:09.820 --> 16:13.940
Toho Academy's Wakashimazu-kun... Their iron defense doesn't allow any goals through.

16:14.720 --> 16:18.170
Though being successful in the city tournament isn't out of the question,

16:18.170 --> 16:25.120
I wonder how Toho Academy will do in the national tournament without Hyuga-kun.

16:25.940 --> 16:28.030
The game is now over!

16:28.030 --> 16:31.940
This year, Toho Academy enters the national tournament!

16:32.350 --> 16:33.310
Captain...

16:33.780 --> 16:36.550
How long will you make us wait?

16:43.460 --> 16:46.820
Shoot towards the huge wave!

16:53.710 --> 16:57.100
While I was forced to play Toho's soccer style,

16:57.100 --> 17:00.680
Ohzora Tsubasa grew towards his own.

17:00.680 --> 17:04.020
Damn!  I don't want to lose to Tsubasa anymore!

17:04.860 --> 17:07.740
I will defeat Tsubasa using my own soccer style!

17:09.290 --> 17:11.660
That's right, Kojiro!  Break through it!

17:14.090 --> 17:16.540
Shoot the ball beyond the wave!

17:18.940 --> 17:21.420
In order to fight with Ohzora Tsubasa,

17:21.420 --> 17:24.350
I will return before the national tournament starts.

17:24.350 --> 17:28.860
Wakashimazu and Takeshi, take care of the team until I get back.

17:33.130 --> 17:35.880
It has been one week since the captain disappeared.

17:35.880 --> 17:38.060
The national tournament will begin tomorrow.

17:38.060 --> 17:40.140
Will he be back in time?

17:41.320 --> 17:42.650
Hyuga-san...

17:43.660 --> 17:47.220
Hyuga-san must've gone to Coach Kira's place.

17:47.220 --> 17:48.770
He will definitely come back.

17:48.770 --> 17:49.670
Yeah.

17:52.880 --> 17:54.700
Hyuga-san...

18:16.310 --> 18:17.210
Crap...!

18:29.450 --> 18:30.910
Not yet...

18:35.810 --> 18:39.980
There is a terrible typhoon.  Seven will reach the land, and possibly more.

18:40.500 --> 18:44.500
There will be high waves offshore, so keep a watch and be very careful on the coast.

19:10.440 --> 19:14.380
I'm... going to get my soccer style back,

19:14.380 --> 19:17.420
then I'll defeat Ohzora Tsubasa...!

19:21.250 --> 19:22.990
Ohzora Tsubasa!

19:22.990 --> 19:24.660
I challenge you!

19:43.310 --> 19:45.410
You've succeeded, Kojiro.

19:47.540 --> 19:51.130
That tiger-like fighting spirit...

19:51.130 --> 19:53.200
is your true form.

20:19.370 --> 20:21.320
Kojiro, get up.

20:23.420 --> 20:25.220
Coach Kira.

20:28.130 --> 20:31.340
It seems you're back to your old self.

20:31.340 --> 20:32.450
Yeah.

20:32.450 --> 20:34.980
Toho's game will begin at 2PM this afternoon.

20:35.570 --> 20:37.210
Go, Kojiro.

20:37.210 --> 20:39.500
Play as wildly as you can!

20:39.830 --> 20:40.790
Okay!

20:42.950 --> 20:45.220
The tournament finally begins.

20:45.220 --> 20:46.850
People are wondering if Nankatsu Junior High of Shizuoka

20:46.850 --> 20:49.940
can manage to be the first in history with three consecutive wins.

20:49.940 --> 20:52.200
In this National Junior High School Soccer Tournament,

20:52.650 --> 20:55.650
the first game will begin right away.

21:01.150 --> 21:03.100
There's still a lot of time before the game.

21:03.100 --> 21:05.970
You should all relax your bodies before it starts.

21:05.970 --> 21:06.660
Okay.

21:06.660 --> 21:09.400
The game will begin soon.

21:09.400 --> 21:11.580
Will the captain come back?

21:11.580 --> 21:13.710
Hyuga-san will surely come.

21:13.710 --> 21:14.510
Sawada!

21:14.510 --> 21:15.140
Yes?!

21:15.520 --> 21:17.860
Don't talk about the person who gave up on the team!

21:18.430 --> 21:19.700
Coach...

21:28.380 --> 21:29.360
Hyuga-san!

21:29.360 --> 21:30.220
Captain.

21:31.420 --> 21:34.280
Coach, I'm back now.

21:40.540 --> 21:43.390
Hyuga, why did you bother coming back?

21:43.390 --> 21:45.300
I won't use you in this tournament.

21:56.000 --> 21:57.510
What are you saying?

21:58.420 --> 22:00.750
Not... use me?

22:04.300 --> 22:07.060
We, Nankatsu Junior High, entered the national tournament.

22:07.060 --> 22:09.260
It's our dream to win three consecutive times,

22:09.750 --> 22:13.740
but there is a huge wall before us:

22:13.740 --> 22:17.660
the defender with absolute power, Jito Hiroshi of Hirano Junior High.

22:17.660 --> 22:21.350
His powerful tackle has opened my eyes.

22:21.350 --> 22:23.940
I've never imagined that the goal would be that far.

22:24.450 --> 22:26.110
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:26.110 --> 22:27.980
A Challenge From Jito.

22:27.980 --> 22:28.780
Look forward to it!

22:29.050 --> 22:31.620
Aim for the tomorrow.  Get Goal!
